            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.76</h2><ul><li>Filters local speech-recognition placeholder text such as blank audio, no speech detected, inaudible, and unintelligible before Companion Realtime Voice sends a turn to the middle brain.</li><li>Keeps Companion Realtime Voice aligned with the iOS placeholder/no-speech guard added for the latest phone build.</li><li>Preserves the Cerebras middle-brain and local iPhone action fixes from the prior releases.</li></ul>
]]></description>
